{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "satusehat-laravel-routes-v1",
    "name": "SatuSehat - Laravel Debug Routes",
    "description": "Collection untuk testing route SatuSehat di Laravel (prefix /satusehat). Semua route dilindungi middleware auth — pastikan sudah login atau set cookie session yang valid.\n\nSet variable `base_url` sesuai environment lokal Anda.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "URL aplikasi Laravel lokal"
    },
    {
      "key": "org_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "SATUSEHAT_ORGANIZATION_ID faskes"
    },
    {
      "key": "patient_nik",
      "value": "3174051612870001",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "NIK pasien untuk testing"
    },
    {
      "key": "patient_ihs_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "IHS Number pasien dari SatuSehat"
    },
    {
      "key": "practitioner_nik",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "NIK dokter untuk testing"
    },
    {
      "key": "practitioner_ihs_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "IHS Number dokter dari SatuSehat"
    },
    {
      "key": "encounter_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Encounter ID dari SatuSehat"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🏠 Dashboard",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Debug Dashboard (HTML)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/satusehat",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["satusehat"]
            },
            "description": "Halaman HTML berisi daftar semua route, status token cache, dan info environment."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "🔐 Token / Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Info Token (Cache)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "pm.test('Status ok', function () {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json.status).to.eql('ok');",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Token preview ada', function () {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json.token_preview).to.be.a('string');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/satusehat/token",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["satusehat", "token"]
            },
            "description": "Tampilkan info token aktif (nilai disamarkan). Jika belum ada di cache, akan request ke SatuSehat API.\n\nResponse:\n- `from_cache`: apakah token dari cache atau fresh\n- `token_preview`: 12 karakter awal + *** + 12 karakter akhir\n- `token_length`: panjang token"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Token OK (dari cache)",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/satusehat/token" }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "body": "{\n  \"status\": \"ok\",\n  \"from_cache\": true,\n  \"token_preview\": \"eyJhbGciOiJSU...**********************************...*VhbGlkYXRpb24\",\n  \"token_length\": 1024,\n  \"cache_key\": \"satusehat_access_token\",\n  \"message\": \"Token diambil dari cache\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Force Refresh Token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "pm.test('Bukan dari cache', function () {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json.from_cache).to.eql(false);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/satusehat/token/refresh",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["satusehat", "token", "refresh"]
            },
            "description": "Paksa hapus cache token lama dan minta token baru dari SatuSehat OAuth2 API.\n\nGunakan saat:\n- Token expired sebelum waktunya\n- Ganti credentials\n- Debugging auth"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "🏥 Organization & Location",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Organization (dari .env)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "pm.test('ResourceType Organization', function () {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json.resourceType).to.eql('Organization');",
                  "});",
                  "// Simpan ID ke variable",
                  "var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.id) { pm.collectionVariables.set('org_id', json.id); }"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/satusehat/organization",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["satusehat", "organization"]
            },
            "description": "Ambil data Organization faskes menggunakan `SATUSEHAT_ORGANIZATION_ID` dari `.env`. Akan error 422 jika env belum diset."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
